      <VERS vnumber="9"> We have <gr str="1819">thought </gr>of thy <gr str="2617">lovingkindness</gr>, O <gr str="430">God</gr>, in the <gr str="7130">midst </gr>of thy <gr str="1964">temple</gr>. </VERS>
